From: Eduardo Ruiz <335073+eduarbo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:11:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Keep a video's streams from its lead-in measure

ffmpeg's pass over a video's first frames also lists its streams: the
video's size and whether it has sound are kept with its lead-in, and the
player starts from them instead of waiting for VLC to parse the file
(about a quarter of a second for a card's first video).
---
